``` 

This code also handles memory allocation failures and uses the least significant bits of the seed for random number generation. However, this example does not handle reusing previously allocated memory or handling varying numbers of records efficiently. You may need to develop more sophisticated data structures, algorithms, or use an external library that provides these functionalities.
